he few-shot regime and\ncompeting with much larger LLMs. We find that the size and entity-type\ndiversity of the pre-training dataset are key to achieving good performance. We\nview NuNER as a member of the broader family of task-specific foundation\nmodels, recently unlocked by LLMs.","upvotes":17,"discussionId":"65e1dbfdd6ad9743c9e55b6d","githubRepo":"https://github.com/Serega6678/NuNER","githubRepoAddedBy":"auto","ai_summary":"NuNER, a compact language representation model specialized in Named Entity Recognition, outperforms similar-sized foundation models in few-shot tasks and competes with larger LLMs.","ai_keywords":["Large Language Models","LLMs","NuNER","Named Entity Recognition","NER","pre-training dataset","foundation models","task-specific foundation models"],"ai_summary_model":"Qwen/Qwen2.5-Coder-32B-Instruct","githubStars":15,"linkedModels":[{"author":"numind","authorData":{"_id":"649be9407e233de345002dd3","avatarUrl":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/649be8cf867d442094248a40/p-vHYU5a6a6AlAqj0D1P7.png","fullname":"NuMind","name":"numind","type":"org","isHf":false,"isHfAdmin":false,"isMod":false,"followerCount":692,"isUserFollowing":false},"downloads":14166,"gated":false,"id":"numind/NuNER_Zero","availableInferenceProviders":[],"lastModified":"2025-02-26T13:28:29.000Z","likes":115,"pipeline_tag":"token-classification","private":false,"repoType":"model","isLikedByUser":false,"widgetOutputUrls":[],"numParameters":448872192},{"author":"numind","authorData":{"_id":"649be9407e233de345002dd3","avatarUrl":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/649be8cf867d442094248a40/p-vHYU5a6a6AlAqj0D1P7.png","fullname":"NuMind","name":"numind","type":"org","isHf":false,"isHfAdmin":false,"isMod":false,"followerCount":692,"isUserFollowing":false},"downloads":5912,"gated":false,"id":"numind/NuNER-multilingual-v0.1","availableInferenceProviders":[],"lastModified":"2024-03-15T13:03:34.000Z","likes":71,"pipeline_tag":"token-classification